Whisper: the installer and uninstaller contact nobody

What: the installer no longer sends its install ping (SendPingIfApplicable, an HTTP
POST to incoming.telemetry.mozilla.org after every install, silent or not), the
uninstaller no longer sends an uninstall ping there (un.SendUninstallPing), and its
last page no longer has the "Tell Mozilla why you uninstalled" checkbox, which opened
a survey on qsurvey.mozilla.com.
Why: Whisper does not report on its users, and Mozilla is not the maker of Whisper.
Firefox's installer sent the install ping regardless of any browser setting. The
functions stay in place and return at once, so the rest of the installer is
unchanged.
---
--- a/browser/installer/windows/nsis/installer.nsi
+++ b/browser/installer/windows/nsis/installer.nsi
@@ -1017,6 +1017,9 @@
 ; since we'd be double-counting the number of installations. The stub installer
 ; is repsonsible for sending the ping in that case.
 Function SendPingIfApplicable
+  ; Whisper: no install ping to Mozilla's telemetry server
+  ; (patches/0034-installer-contacts-nobody.patch).
+  Return
   ClearErrors
   ${GetParameters} $0
   ${GetOptions} $0 "/LaunchedFromStub" $0
--- a/browser/installer/windows/nsis/uninstaller.nsi
+++ b/browser/installer/windows/nsis/uninstaller.nsi
@@ -199,10 +199,8 @@
 !insertmacro MUI_UNPAGE_INSTFILES
 
 ; Finish Page
-!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_SHOWREADME
-!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_SHOWREADME_NOTCHECKED
-!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_SHOWREADME_TEXT $(UN_SURVEY_CHECKBOX_LABEL)
-!define MUI_FINISHPAGE_SHOWREADME_FUNCTION un.Survey
+; Whisper: without Mozilla's "Tell Mozilla why you uninstalled" checkbox, which
+; opened a survey on qsurvey.mozilla.com (patches/0034-installer-contacts-nobody.patch).
 !define MUI_PAGE_CUSTOMFUNCTION_PRE un.preFinish
 !define MUI_PAGE_CUSTOMFUNCTION_SHOW un.showFinish
 !insertmacro MUI_UNPAGE_FINISH
@@ -328,6 +326,9 @@
 FunctionEnd
 
 Function un.SendUninstallPing
+  ; Whisper: no uninstall ping to Mozilla's telemetry server
+  ; (patches/0034-installer-contacts-nobody.patch).
+  Return
   ; Notably, we only check the non-private AUMID here. There's no good reason
   ; to send the uninstall ping twice.
   ${If} $AppUserModelID == ""
